OL,5,G2000 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FIn Surrey, can Kirstie help Elise
OL,7,     Fand Elliot finally fly the nest
OL,8,     Finto a place of their own? And
OL,9,     FPhil's with Kim and Ralph, who
OL,10,     Fwant a taste of what they grew up
OL,11,     Fwith in Zimbabwe.
OL,12,G2100 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FKevin McCloud meets Jaime and his
OL,14,     Fwife Mimi, who are converting a
OL,15,     Flisted mini castle in
OL,16,     FBuckinghamshire into a family
OL,17,     Fhome. But will their wildly
OL,18,     Foptimistic schedule be a problem?
